      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2104653434691453304",
      "text": "Payton Tolle was asked about the personality differences between him and Cam Schlittler. Mentioned he's never spoken with Schlittler. Also, discussed how being overly locked in never worked for him. He's at his best when smiling and being comfortable. https://t.co/YmbREMkzDM",
      "url": "https://x.com/tylermilliken_/status/2104653434691453304",
      "published": "2026-09-28T19:24:16+00:00",
      "likes": 697,
      "author": "Tyler Milliken",
      "handle": "tylermilliken_",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2099509768268423168/WLrJwUcb_normal.jpg",
