      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2104644158354825557",
      "text": "Payton Tolle says that Chad Tracy was that “calm presence” the Red Sox needed in the clubhouse and as a team.",
      "url": "https://x.com/BostonStrong_34/status/2104644158354825557",
      "published": "2026-09-28T18:47:24+00:00",
      "likes": 616,
      "author": "Boston Strong",
      "handle": "BostonStrong_34",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1874931658396213248/PqTffpDq_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2104642833068228847",
      "text": "Payton Tolle just walked into the Yankees Stadium press conference room and couldn’t believe how much bigger it is than the one at Fenway. Then he heard reporters need to raise their hand to be given a microphone to ask questions, and exclaimed, “This is so official!”",
      "url": "https://x.com/gfstarr1/status/2104642833068228847",
      "published": "2026-09-28T18:42:08+00:00",
      "likes": 577,
      "author": "Gabrielle Starr",
      "handle": "gfstarr1",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1856923248312696832/6raeafIc_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2104645797824315542",
      "text": "My take on Cam Schlittler will always be the same. An odd guy who is filthy on the mound. If Tolle can cancel him out then he’s useless for the rest of this series. Even though I’m sure he already has some goofy tweet ready to go either way.",
      "url": "https://x.com/Steve_Perrault/status/2104645797824315542",
      "published": "2026-09-28T18:53:55+00:00",
      "likes": 425,
      "author": "Steve Perrault",
      "handle": "Steve_Perrault",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2102600052610891776/415-lUlW_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2104659197648367866",
